{"server":"cn","storyId":"act15side_level_act15side_04_end","groupId":"act15side","stageId":"act15side_04","title":"秉烛","storyCode":"IW-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"54a988a920b00e90963571541044aee5a4e86c45ac002323c6c44f4755492c8a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"克洛丝再次被名为左乐的少年找上，对方坦白了大炎司岁台的存在，并向罗德岛提出合作。老鲤与梁洵推杯换盏，一醉之间，窥伺到了某个恐怖的真相。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"4下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天还真是一无所获......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在龙门的侦探事务所待着的时候，不会这么麻烦的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是梁大人给你的线索太少了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，因为我在龙门......有很多朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我在尚蜀的朋友，除了那位足不出户的梁大人，就只剩您啦，慎师傅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"门口是不是站了太多人了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们可没打算藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......喂，那个龙门人也在这儿，对......别轻举妄动，别让他们离开就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看好他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我们这算是自投罗网了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......奇怪，他们过去再怎么风光，如今也不过开几家饭馆酒楼而已，真有这么多人能攀上关系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的过客","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这周围没其他——等、等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的路人们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尚......尚师傅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......坐，请坐。喝杯茶不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我打听过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有这么几个地方，人迹罕至，但有一些古时候留下来的亭子，我都替你标在地图上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于卖酒水的地方，但凡有村落的，九成都有卖酒的铺子。硬要说，这几处都符合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"取江峰边有一处？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是没印象。不过告诉我的老钱，非说有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些地儿，都是偏僻山路。寻常游客不会走的，要注意安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，多谢尚师傅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚师傅，您和门外那些人......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的路人们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（快去告诉掌柜的......尚师傅和这个龙门人有来往！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的过客","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那我们还堵门吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（堵啥呀，先撤吧，走走走。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g10_lianghouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你回了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"徒劳无功，梁大人就别问了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是担心有贼人惦记你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只要梁大人还惦记着贼人，贼人就不敢惦记我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何况，这烫手酒盏也不在我手里了，梁大人反倒该小心才是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......无妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"袭击你的人查到了，一场误会，将你误认为偷窃文物的走私贩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来尚蜀侠风仍在啊。只是“误会”，就如此大打出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就莫怪他们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慎师傅，老鲤他毕竟不是本地人，这些天，恐怕都要麻烦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有的事儿，听您吩咐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正是码头繁忙的时候，这些日子落下的工钱，我会加倍付给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别，梁大人，咱们可是向来不谈钱的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我却是不能亏待百姓的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你帮过我太多了，也许以后还需要你帮我更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。既然梁大人有这个心，我也就不推辞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些时日，我都陪着鲤小子就是，尚蜀三山十七峰，挑山走水两路人，门清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有劳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——梁洵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们屋里说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得先前我说过，只要梁大人没有事情瞒着我，这件事就不复杂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，这只酒盏，和它的主人，藏了多大秘密？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我在山上，又遇到那伙人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你那个所谓的“误会”，实在没有什么说服力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牵扯多大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你该早点告诉我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怕你知道太多，反而被牵扯其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道我现在没有被牵扯其中吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好好歇息，若是实在难寻......也就算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都到这一步了，你总不能突然心里有愧吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好意心领了。我如果真的算了，你肯定没好日子过，我清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那这事儿究竟牵扯什么？总能说说吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关乎民生社稷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实天大，就是突然这么玄乎，让人不可置信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从不拿这些开玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我当然知道梁大人从不拿这些事情开玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那容我换个问题，今晚总不会还有姑娘来找你吧，梁大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我与宁小姐确实没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没说你俩有什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你眼神可不是这么说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当真？你梁洵虽然天天被嘲讽是个木头人，但是槐天裴的女儿都这么大了，你总不能还没开窍吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有苦衷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......喝酒吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我总该陪你喝一杯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，对，你总该陪我喝一杯了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g03_yandowntown_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛丝姐姐的身手果然够快，看来掌柜的所言非虚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位使扇子的小哥呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万一有什么陷阱，总不能眼睁睁看着全军覆没吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真稀奇，我本以为克洛丝姐姐该派那个小哥来，自己则躲在暗处等待才是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"常言道丢车保帅，克洛丝姐姐不仅是那个“帅”，更是个本就擅长逃脱的弩手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽管如此，你还是亲自来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁让小乌有还不是咱们的正式干员呢，总不能把他往火坑里推吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是，我想克洛丝姐姐也会只身犯险吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您喜欢通过“我一眼把你看穿了”来显得自己很聪明，那我能不能先回去休息休息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈，真性情，那就当我说废话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直说吧，我们稍微调查了一下罗德岛，时间仓促，没太多讯息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛丝姐姐的为人，我已经初见一二。不敢说什么了解，但我是信得过的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......信得过？我不仅掺和了你们的事情，而且还是个感染者喔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"良才善用，能者居之，矿石病是每个感染者个人的不幸，与他们的责任或能力何干？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想让罗德岛帮我们一个忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，换句话说，罗德岛如果不帮这个忙，就算是和我们作对了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要鲤先生的盏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那夜离开梁府后，踪迹就变成了两个人，夜色浓，你们动作很快，但我始终盯着其中一个——从梁府离开的那个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过很快我就跟丢了，然后出现在我面前的，仿佛是一个故意要把我引开的人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个客栈老板把我引开，是为了掩护你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不枉掌柜的对你如此高看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只盏和“岁”有什么关系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道“岁”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵......看来克洛丝姐姐虽然没说谎，可话只说了一半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，有吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"岂止是你们把年和夕当作了朋友......既然她连这些事情都告诉你们，那她们分明是把罗德岛当成了救命稻草。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是放在几十年几百年前，她们如何行动，但凡没有坏了规矩，那司岁台根本不会理睬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可如今不同了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不光时局变化，你们与年交好，还擅自将夕带离了山头，这件事让司岁台大为光火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你们是无意的，可下一步呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大炎要怎么确定，她们聚在一起，没有什么惊天的阴谋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“大炎”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我可不是在危言耸听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年和夕在靠近尚蜀之后便不知所踪，而恰好此时，出现了一只与她们都有关系的酒盏，而这一切的相关人，又都在“罗德岛”身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这实在是巧得不能再巧了。你说是吧，克洛丝姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我相信，天底下没有这么巧的事情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g02_yanalley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎哟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"衣服洗了忘记晾了。糟糟糟......今天不晾，明天没得换洗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......尚冢啊，你不该来这里的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧走啦，走我就当没看见啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天有个年轻人，让我在山上找亭子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......大伙都知道你离开的时候情形复杂，但是没个交代，还暗算掌柜的，按规矩你就是叛徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后你们的人把他围了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叛徒大哥，尚大哥，我求求你，被别人看到，我就只能动手了喔？伤和气的喔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大哥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我问你他是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是个龙门人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是生意而已，和外人无关，无可奉告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等今年过了，就十年整了。我打算最近就给镖局一个交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给你们一个交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是找郑清钺做个了断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是不能告诉你啊，尚大哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刘二！当年是谁把你从火里救出来的！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......和那只酒盏有关，对不对？和十年前那只酒盏有关，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看来是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些年轻人嘴里说的“酒盏”，果然就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你不是私下逼问了年轻的学徒吧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......天意啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——喂，尚冢！问完就走啊，讲不讲情义啊！喂！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，酒量到底还是变了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是以前的梁洵，现在早该往桌子下钻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偶尔独酌，久而久之。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是梁大人，当了官还有闲情独酌——等等，你这所谓的偶尔独酌，该不会是因为？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愁更愁罢了，人之常情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......人们也常说，一个人酒量变了，人也就变了。你觉得有道理不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不无道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，杯中物杯中物，杯中装的是人情世故啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实话说，这次来尚蜀见你，我心里惊讶不小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，为何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁让我只认识那个一板一眼，不苟言笑的梁洵呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得在学校的时候，先师阁外边，你曾说要为天下人谋福，你说大地凄苦寒凉，就让天下人共生火共取热，再见不到半点黑暗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......年轻时的豪言壮语，也是梁某人一直用以自省的初心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多年前啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是很多年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也已经不是当年那个风流潇洒的大少爷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虚度光阴罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......离家这么久，可有和家人联络过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚出家门没多久呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说，龙门那侦探事务所，如今才是你的家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那江东那边......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一座宅邸，几挂灯笼，些许故人罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你我都变了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿我们如今碰杯，听见的不是过去凌云意气破碎的声响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，也不对，如今梁大人官拜四品，乃是一城知府，既然百姓对你满意，你岂非已经达成昔日愿景了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路还长。尚蜀本就生机勃勃，梁某做的事，不过锦上添花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就还望梁大人不忘初心，干杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g03_yandowntown_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大炎的神秘学研究始终是这片大地最深邃的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可别说得好像是我们不愿意分享似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然形式各不相同，但是大地各国确实也在用自己的方式去对待同样的问题。摆在大地上的问题总是一致的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，出于某些......历史原因。在“巨兽学”这方面，放眼泰拉，大炎司岁台只会是一枝独秀，过去是，未来也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在谢拉格还将它们当作神明崇拜，在萨米依旧与它们共存的现今，司岁台的研究，早已极深研几，无微不至。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，司岁台的“岁”字，是年提起过的那个“岁”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年告诉过你那些传说吗？古代帝皇、围猎、崛起之物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是小炎熔说的那些......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾被古时候的人们普遍认作“神明”的某种生物，随着文明兴起，它们逐渐隐匿了身形。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所谓的“岁”，就是其中之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“某种生物”......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于它们是否符合生物的定义，我想我们没必要空费口舌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只需要知道，当它们祸国殃民的时刻，大炎有能力消灭它们，这就足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......挺有道理的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些虽然称不上司岁台机密，可终归也不是什么众人皆知的知识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉克洛丝姐姐这些，可不是打算搞什么学术会谈啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......年，夕，还有躲在尚蜀某处的那一位。这些家伙始终在司岁台的监视之下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来，任何事情都不会仓促到如此地步，直到有天，那座山头突然云开雾散，等到司岁台秉烛人赶到时，夕早已不见踪影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没几天前的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台的秉烛人们将此事回报给朝廷，也没花几天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......了不起，灰齐山离大炎首都有相当远的距离吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛是在不知全貌的情况下介入此事，不知者无罪。可反过来说，一无所知，还敢与那两人共事，实在匪夷所思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，我们希望罗德岛能遵循司岁台的安排，说服那龙门人，将酒盏主动交还给我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......果然，梁洵从一开始就接到了你们的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他让鲤先生把东西从龙门送来，然后假装被抢走，暗度陈仓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你直呼知府名讳，却依旧称那龙门人为“先生”，说明你确实是个好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“好人”在炎国话里有别的意思吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别误会，我没那么拐弯抹角，只是说你毫不掩饰对那龙门人的信任罢了。是因为那人和罗德岛有合作关系吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实也不止是普通的合作关系啦......也是朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......朋友总是不多的。年和夕，似乎也是你的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听你说的话，司岁台在大炎似乎地位崇高，那你们刻意演这出戏，到底要掩谁的耳目？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这恐怕就超过罗德岛需要知道的范畴了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"承认得这么坦荡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又不是什么见不得人的事情，只不过碍于官场颜面，做得讨巧罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，告诉了罗德岛如此多的事，接下来，是不是能放下成见谈合作了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要罗德岛帮你们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也让鲤先生好做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除岁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没醉，不用这么扶着我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是被你从龙门使唤过来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我有想过，信使到了龙门，未必能找到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在龙门注册那个事务所的时候，其实想着的，就是能被你们找到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“鲤氏”，可你为何突然想到要在龙门安身立业？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁叫那里已经是大炎最靠边的地方了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再往外......我就无处可去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你可以回来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想回了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁洵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其实知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一向都是知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门终究不是你的家，你却期盼了龙门半辈子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为在那里，我就能找到我一直想做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你找到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了，可我发现其实在哪里，我都能找到它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年槐天裴说自己习武，便要争个天下闻名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年梁洵想为天下人多做些事，想教这世道不必再使人担惊受怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年我只是一尾过江鳞。不过跃出水面几分，便以为天高地阔，皆是我乡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"困了困了，明儿个还要劳累，你先走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保重。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......酒没剩下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"故人，故人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_i03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......一记妙手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已经落了下风，是不是就不必继续下去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不必继续下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"文人四艺，琴棋书画。你总不能次次挑着“棋”字与我较劲，这不是欺负人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"做人还是要懂得扬长避短。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"诗词歌赋，我又有哪样比得过你呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"又感到无趣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太平盛世。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可这太平盛世，只是大炎的太平盛世。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的子，可落不在大炎之外的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是，我的棋盘只在大炎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可每盘棋的手谈之人，未必在我。那其他棋局，也就在大地各处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们能与你有关吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"观棋不语真君子，落子无悔大丈夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你就只是看看。看着那些人类......纷争中的人类，纠缠中的人类。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是靠观棋悟棋道罢了，懵懂孩童都是从模仿学起的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可你不是他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是......哦，你手里握着他的一枚子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你替他下棋？来自龙门的鲤先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什......我......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔。这可......稀奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他为什么要将你一个寻常人拉进局中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，还是说，他没有刻意选择你，他只是算到了，任何人任何事，都迟早会促成如今这个结果？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在说，你并非那个已经万念俱灰的人。但你却坐在了他的位置上，与我下棋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是哪儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一个......百年前的梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有些玩笑了，我如何梦见一个百年前的梦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的梦中人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你如何梦见的呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"你是来做什么的！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......好像做了个不得了的梦......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窗外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"站住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......这声音......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
